{"availability":"available","full":"integry/propr","name":"propr","description":"Open source, self-hosted GitHub orchestration for AI coding agents. Runs Claude Code, Codex, Antigravity, OpenCode and Mistral Vibe on your server and ships every change as a reviewed pull request: issue to PR, AI code review, automated fix loops.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":14,"forks":6,"created":"2025-05-23T13:09:47Z","updated":"2026-10-06T09:08:18Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://propr.dev","topics":["agent-orchestration","agentic-coding","ai-agents","ai-code-review","ai-coding","antigravity","claude","claude-code","code-review","codex","coding-agent","coding-agents","devtools","github-automation","github-bot","mcp","mistral","opencode","pull-requests","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://demo.propr.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:08:54.570Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T09:08:54.570Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T09:08:54.570Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:40.805Z","stars":14,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-06T09:08:54.570Z","stars":14,"forks":6}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Manage AI coding agents like human engineers — plan, implement, review, and ship every change as a real pull request.","Website · Documentation · Live demo · Discord · Built with ProPR","ProPR is a self-hosted platform that runs AI coding agents like Claude Code and Codex through the GitHub pull-request workflow. It monitors issues and PRs, runs your choice of agents in isolated Docker containers and Git worktrees on your own server, and drives the complete path from an issue to a reviewed pull request — with a Web UI available for configuration and monitoring and a CLI that doubles as the local control plane. You bring your existing AI subscriptions or API keys; ProPR never marks up tokens."],"features":["Tasks and goals: start a single instruction or steer a long-running native agent session with corrective inputs.","Inbox and push: follow work across browser, installed PWA and desktop, with personal and repository notification controls.","MCP connections: authorize connected apps and use scoped tools for activity, plans, goals, tasks and PRs.","Multi-agent: Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, Google Antigravity, OpenCode, and Mistral Vibe — all first-class, selectable per issue","Label-based model routing: pick the agent/model per issue with llm-- labels; multiple labels fan out into parallel jobs"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/integry/propr/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"40d1408c01175965d403841117f8097724a42a9463b41308733a0e78cbf19a5d","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:40.946Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:40.946Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Manage AI coding agents like human engineers — plan, implement, review, and ship every change as a real pull request.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/integry/propr/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Web UI dashboard: configure repositories, branches, labels, agents, and defaults; watch tasks, logs, commits, and cost in real time","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/integry/propr/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You need a Linux amd64 host with a maintained Docker Engine release, direct access to its Docker socket, Node.js 22 or 24, GitHub access, and a provider account for at least one coding agent.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/integry/propr/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Reuse a host login (claude auth login, agy login, …), create one through the agent image with propr agent login , or add the agent in the Web UI and log in directly to an isolated ProPR-managed credential directory.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/integry/propr/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"40d1408c01175965d403841117f8097724a42a9463b41308